          <heading>Purpose</heading>
          <paragraph eId="art_1__para_1">
            <num>1.</num>
            <content><p>This Act promotes open access to publicly funded research data.</p></content>
          </paragraph>
        </article>
        <article eId="art_2">
          <num>Article 2</num>
          <heading>Definitions</heading>
          <paragraph eId="art_2__para_1">
            <num>1.</num>
            <content><p>“Research data” has the meaning given in <ref href="/akn/eu/directive/2019-06-20/1024">Directive (EU) 2019/1024</ref>.</p></content>
          </paragraph>
          <paragraph eId="art_2__para_2">
            <num>2.</num>
            <content><p>“Repository” means a service that preserves data.</p></content>
          </paragraph>
